AX_Modules

The UI toolkit of WaypointUI by AdaptiveX (its `packages` folder), licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 3. AX_Modules is distributed under the same licence (see LICENSE).
Named in honour of AdaptiveX (AX).

Changes from WaypointUI:
- Moved out of the addon into a standalone folder embedded per addon, used by AX_Settings and by
  the addon itself.
- Renamed from `packages`: its module registry (module-registry, env.modules in WaypointUI) is
  env.AX_Modules, and module names start with ax_modules\ instead of packages\.
- Texture paths are relative to the toolkit's own folder (path: Path.Modules).
- Some modules were edited for the settings framework, and some it doesn't use were left out.
- Added a WoW Forever art variant: recoloured widget sheets in uic-common\resources\forever,
  picked by game version (path: Path.Skin, Path.Skinned).
